Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, King of Kings!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.27,0:01:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.67,0:01:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Kyber served a fancy chow\Nlike this and made it all you can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to be sorry\Nby the time I'm through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.91,0:01:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That mind-controlling menace is\Ngoing to get what's coming to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.39,0:01:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait till he has to duel me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.23,0:01:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone seems on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, pre-final jitters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, how'd you\Nqualify so fast anyway? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I won all six locator cards at once. Eh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, Bakura! You won\Nsix cards in one duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.29,0:01:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be It was simple\NI battled Bones and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.71,0:01:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,his gang of zombie duelists\Nin the cemetery When I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.43,0:02:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,defeated them using some\Nghosts of my own I got
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.29,0:02:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,them to give up all their\Nlocator cards But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.07,0:02:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just say I didn't\Ngive those fellows much choice
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You forced them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.85,0:02:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sort of Dueling Bones in a cemetery\Nand forcing him to give up everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.99,0:02:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.29,0:02:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.25,0:02:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheerio, and good luck in your first duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be good luck if I\Ndon't have to duel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.19,0:02:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like you just saw a zombie, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's just a shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's been sitting out too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.53,0:02:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't throw up on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.27,0:02:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,When are we going to find\Nout who we duel, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.79,0:02:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in quite a rush\Njust to lose, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.33,0:02:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, but only seven\Nfinalists are present.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I bring up the eighth one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.67,0:02:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.93,0:02:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.07,0:03:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Finalists and guests, may I\Nhave your attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.99,0:03:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the first two duelists for\Nround one will be chosen by lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the jackpot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To guarantee fairness, each pair of opponents\Nwill be selected completely at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.87,0:03:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You've all been assigned a\Nnumber from one through eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The selector will now choose\Nthe first two numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.23,0:03:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The second pair of\Nnumbers will not be drawn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,until a winner is declared\Nin the first duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, you will not know your opponent's\Nidentity until just before you duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.07,0:03:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting the urge to yell out bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, I'll laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.33,0:03:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All eight balls are of\Nequal size and weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The selector produces results\Nthat are 100 % random.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Does everyone remember his or her number?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.85,0:03:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon, ma 'am. What is it? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has requested your presence at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.59,0:04:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to watch the finalists\Nbeing paired off for the first duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.15,0:04:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.29,0:04:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then my presence is not required.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.55,0:04:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Some things cannot be explained,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.21,0:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can assure you with certainty that\NI will not be chosen for the first duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know who will, and the fate of the\Nentire world depends upon his victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall now begin selecting the first\Ntwo duelists for the finals round one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll engage the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.01,0:04:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Random select.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.77,0:04:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,if your number is chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.05,0:04:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be participating in the first\Nduel of the Battle City finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And the first duelist is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.81,0:04:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Number six, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I duel first?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.27,0:04:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you're all right, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You should really be in bed resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You just got out of\Nthe hospital, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't even be\Nwalking, let alone dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's fishy on this blimp,\Nand it's not the baked salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.89,0:04:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No way you healed that fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.43,0:04:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Being the first duelist chosen just took\Nme by surprise Stand by while we choose the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.91,0:05:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,next duelist Please note\Nthe selection process
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,is final When the second\Nduelist is chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,both participants must\Nproceed directly to the arena
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura's opponent in the first\Nduel is Duelist number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Moto. The first duel of the Battle\NCity finals will begin immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.31,0:05:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,In the Stratos dueling arena, I guess\NI'm battling Yugi. This should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.25,0:05:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Bakura will fare\Nagainst Yugi's Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.47,0:05:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad it's Yugi, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel will be played in accordance\Nwith Battle City rules and regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.89,0:05:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The loser will relinquish his\Nrarest card to the winner,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as be expelled from the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner will advance to round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When the pharaoh loses,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.19,0:05:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll hand his Egyptian God card to\Nthe duelist they think is Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon after, it will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My necklace tells me the pharaoh\Nwill struggle in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.27,0:06:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory will bring me one step closer\Nto obtaining all seven Millennium items.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Battle City finals are about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The arena is located in the upper deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How many decks are on this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.75,0:06:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Duelists six and three follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Those not dueling are welcome to observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.77,0:06:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the central elevator\Nto the Stratos level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.31,0:06:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome. I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.25,0:06:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that's not Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.51,0:06:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the evil spirit\Nof the Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And I bet he's still after\Nthe seven Millennium items.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.77,0:06:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's gonna be tougher\Nthan everyone thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.01,0:07:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I welcome you to the\NStratos Dueling Arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.05,0:07:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I must win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the world depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.07,0:07:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Duelists, take your marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Elevate the playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Dueling up here is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.09,0:07:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and freezing. Oh, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.31,0:07:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the Master of Ceremonies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll make this speech\Nquick so we can begin this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.33,0:07:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Craft 3 is now cruising\Nat an altitude of 4,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The strong winds and cold air will\Ntest your strength and stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.11,0:07:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't take it, you\Ndon't belong here. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I dig this little twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.57,0:07:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to admit it, Kaiba does\Nknow how to throw a tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you prepared to lose it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.85,0:07:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.45,0:07:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we begin this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you tell me who you\Nreally are and stop this charade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.09,0:07:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, have it your way, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It is you, the spirit\Nof the Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.65,0:08:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, he's wearing that\NMillennium Ring again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.95,0:08:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I got rid of it at Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I tossed that thing into the deepest\Npart of the woods, miles from anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how Bakura got it back,\Nbut I know it's not a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.35,0:08:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So why all the fuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.31,0:08:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's around Bakura's neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.73,0:08:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Namu, it's kind of hard to explain,\Nbut that's not really Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.99,0:08:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Yugi and Bakura both had these\Nreal old objects that have magic powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.07,0:08:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's item is good, but\NBakura's item is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because an evil spirit lives inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me there's an\Nevil spirit up there dueling Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I didn't believe it at first either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.47,0:08:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope he doesn't drag\NYug to the Shadow Realm again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.65,0:09:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a place you want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.19,0:09:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.47,0:09:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea that\NI'm really Merrick and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.39,0:09:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,that the evil spirit up\Nthere is working for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.97,0:09:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,now that the introductions are over and\Ndone with, why don't we begin this duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,tell me why you've entered the Battle City\NFinals and what it is you hope to gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it about the Millennium Items?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.19,0:09:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows I desire the\Nseven Millennium Items,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.67,0:09:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but he has no idea how\NI intend to obtain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.03,0:09:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win his Egyptian\NGod card and deliver it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,to Marek in exchange\Nfor the Millennium Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.73,0:09:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then seizing Yugi's puzzle\Nwill be a simple task.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, perhaps there is something else\Nthat I am planning to take away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.09,0:09:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides your Millennium Puzzle,\Nwhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You ask a lot of questions, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There is so much about this\Ntournament that you are
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,unaware of So many secrets being\Nkept from you For instance,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.07,0:10:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,how do you know that I am working alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.43,0:10:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And are you sure that one\Nof the people you believe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.81,0:10:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To be your friend. Isn't\Nreally your greatest enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you\NLies are a part of your
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.33,0:10:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,game But they won't help you in this duel
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.27,0:10:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, you fool You're\Ngiving him too much information.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want the items, you're\Ngoing to play this by my rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.41,0:10:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, you want me to take\Nover your mind and duel him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.65,0:10:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could have defeated him on your own,\Nyou would have done it by now, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.81,0:10:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, the first duel of the\NBattle City finals will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish this evil spirit, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.73,0:10:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.19,0:10:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if Yugi has what it\Ntakes to use his Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.31,0:10:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, the battle that will decide\Nthe future of mankind begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please triumph, my pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.61,0:11:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just know, whatever it is you\Ndesire, you will fail. Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.67,0:11:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It is you who shall lose\Neverything you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,yuki i can assure you that the first\Nduel of the finals will also be your last
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,i shall begin with this the portrait
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.19,0:11:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,secret in attack mode\Nthat'll do for now he
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.17,0:11:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,played a really weak monster in attack\Nmode that's not a smart move at all he
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.47,0:11:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,must be up to something but what i don't\Nget it That monster's no challenge at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.23,0:11:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dismantle that possessed picture frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then now I'll summon Gazelle,\Nthe King of Mythical Beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his monster, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:12:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, now I shall play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.23,0:12:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The gross ghost of fled\Ndreams in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's foul!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.87,0:12:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack my monster if you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ghost is no match for my gazelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.43,0:12:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And with no trap or magic\Ncards, you can't stop my attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.87,0:12:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He must want me to destroy\Nit for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to wipe out his life\Npoints before he finishes his strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.43,0:12:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to extinguish your ghost,\Nleaving your life points wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.25,0:12:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll do it with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are you waiting for? Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.23,0:12:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Gamma the Magnet Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.91,0:12:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his ghost! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, King of Mythical Beasts,\Nattack his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.39,0:13:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush this guy, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not even fighting back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.65,0:13:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's wiped out half his life\Ncoins and the duel just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.19,0:13:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I want that Egyptian god card!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.41,0:13:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yugi, perhaps I've\Nmade things too easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.05,0:13:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.75,0:13:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.31,0:13:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon the Headless\NKnight in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't see your monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps that's because he's a spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.21,0:13:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He hides in the shadows\Nuntil the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This spirit may be stronger\Nthan your last two monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.71,0:13:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's still weaker than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you attack it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.41,0:13:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yugi attacks, Bakura's plan may succeed,\Nbut Yugi has no other choice. Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Gamma the Magnet Warrior, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gazelle, attack his\Nlife points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.01,0:14:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've lost most of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can win this duel with one more attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless his strategy kicks\Nin, now he's finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Something strange is\Ngoing on in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this seems too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.69,0:14:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Or Yugi's fighting the\Nworld's worst duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.33,0:14:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, either way, Yugi's gonna\Nwin this thing in his next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.49,0:14:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to make your final move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.93,0:14:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.53,0:14:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done exactly\Nwhat I wanted you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your destruction begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.45,0:14:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.89,0:14:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Over?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.27,0:14:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's got this clown set up like\Na balloon on a thought board.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.09,0:14:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.09,0:14:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got no monsters left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:15:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's already down to\Nless than 500 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There'd be no point in bluffing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But Korra must have\Nsomething up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A plan to turn the tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.97,0:15:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hold a card in my hand with dark\Npowers beyond your wildest imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.21,0:15:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, before I could play this\Nall-powerful card, I needed a bit of assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping me destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.47,0:15:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Three of my monsters\Nneeded to be destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,before I could bring\Nforth my dark destructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, you made that possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon the beast that will\Ncause your demise, Dark Necrophair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.73,0:15:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.47,0:15:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea what you\Nare about to experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.99,0:15:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were planning something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You still fell into my trap, and now\Nyou're about to pay the ultimate price.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:15:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.05,0:16:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, Yugi. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.81,0:16:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster's creeping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he was willing to lose all\Nthose life points to bring it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,it must be powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Necrofear is one of the most\Ndestructive cards in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.65,0:16:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I know a card in Yugi's deck that can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,His Egyptian god card, the\Nmighty Slifer, the Sky Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It all depends on whether or not\NYugi has the courage to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.99,0:16:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stare into the face of defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, not only is my monster strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.37,0:16:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,possessing more attack points\Nthan either of your monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.77,0:16:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but it also possesses a\Ndark magic hidden within,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting to activate and destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster may be powerful,\Nbut it's not unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.15,0:16:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This Dark Necrofear must\Npossess incredible powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If Bakura risked losing the\Nfinals just to summon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He led Yugi through this\Nduel like a dog on a leash
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.23,0:17:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Bakura has him\Nexactly where he wants him So,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.91,0:17:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,what will you do now, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready to attack\Nyet So, I will end my turn
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't he attack me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,His monster could easily\Ndestroy my Magnet Warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.57,0:17:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,or my Gazelle and seriously\Ndamage my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.77,0:17:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he worried about my face down card?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.07,0:17:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is it something else? Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.55,0:17:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm ready, you were foolish enough\Nnot to attack me when you had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you shall pay the\Nprice as I draw this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This card will destroy his dark necrofear,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.47,0:17:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to wipe out the\Nrest of his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.95,0:17:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.01,0:17:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice Gazelle, the\Nking of mythical beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.45,0:17:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to summon my Dark Magician Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.25,0:18:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool, I'm afraid your magical fairy\Nis too weak to destroy my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.07,0:18:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.53,0:18:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But apparently you've forgotten\Nabout my face down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.15,0:18:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.33,0:18:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my magic formula card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.85,0:18:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Magic Formula raises Dark Magician\NGirl's attack power by 500 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.89,0:18:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,making her more powerful\Nthan your Necrofear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.15,0:18:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, attaboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.49,0:18:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Put that big creep six feet under!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, attack his Necrofear\Nwith Dark Burning Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.05,0:18:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, you've done\Nexactly what I wanted, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize that I've manipulated\Nevery move you've made so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.43,0:18:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Including destroying Dark Necrofear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.15,0:18:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.77,0:18:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch as the entire playing\Nfield is engulfed in
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,a shroud of dark magic\Nknown as Dark Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the evil eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.85,0:19:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.39,0:19:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.87,0:19:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escaping the magic\Nof Dark Sanctuary. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything had to go just right for this\Nto work and you played your part perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.23,0:19:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.59,0:19:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea what you've\Njust helped me to unleash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.47,0:19:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to experience an evil\Nlike you've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
